OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is the appeal of the backyard
OL,4,Aultra?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe backyard ultra is a race that sees
OL,7,Fpeople run 4.16 miles on the hour,
OL,8,Fevery hour until one is left standing.
OL,10,FIt is a concept that started in
OL,11,FAmerica, created by endurance race
OL,12,Fdesigner Lazarus Lake, the same man
OL,13,Fbehind the world-renowned Barkley
OL,14,Fmarathons.
OL,16,FHis event - Big's Backyard Ultra - is
OL,17,Fthe creme de la creme, attracting the
OL,18,Fbest in the game, and requires
OL,19,Fqualification to compete.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
