OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is the appeal of the backyard
OL,4,Aultra?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBackyard ultras have continued to pop
OL,7,Fup on UK soil in recent years, from
OL,8,FLondon to Manchester, Stafford to
OL,9,FScotland. Among those most recently
OL,10,Fannounced is an event in Shropshire.
